    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market, No 197 Glenwood comprises a 3 bedroom semi-detached residence ideally located  in this mature residential development just off the Dublin Road, within walking distance of Louth County Hospital, DKIT, Train Station and Dundalk town center with its hosts of town center amenities. \r\nThis well laid out property briefly comprises, entrance hall, living room, kitchen, dining area, 3 bedrooms overhead and family bathroom. The property has the benefit of off street parking, garden to the front and large rear yard with side entrance. \r\nViewing is highly recommended and the sale of No 197 Glennwood offers an ideal opportunity to acquire a well located property, suitable to owner occupiers or investors."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 4.066m x 1.796m \r\nTiled Floor\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.738m x 3.632m \r\nFireplace \r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.037m x 3.322m \r\nTiled Floor\nFitted Units\nIntegrated Oven & Hob \r\n\r\nDining Area - 3.767m x 2.626m \r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.685m x 3.365m \r\nWardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.607m x 3.685m \r\nWardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.829m x 2.338m \r\nWardrobe\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.426m x 1.949m \r\nWc, Whb, Shower\r\n\r\n"
      },
